ystem in Nigeria’s National Assembly | publisher=Springer International Publishing | publication-place=Cham | date=2019 | isbn=978-3-030-11904-1 | doi=10.1007/978-3-030-11905-8_10 | doi-access=free | url=http://eprints.lmu.edu.ng/3235/1/2019_Book_TheNigerianNationalAssembly.pdf | access-date=9 February 2025}}\n* {{cite book | last=Muheeb | first=Ibraheem O. | title=The Nigerian National Assembly | chapter=The Trajectory of the Legislature, Lawmaking and Legislation in Nigeria | series=Advances in African Economic, Social and Political Development | publisher=Springer International Publishing | publication-place=Cham | date=2019 | pages=33–56 | isbn=978-3-030-11904-1 | doi=10.1007/978-3-030-11905-8_3}}\n* {{cite journal | last1=Arowosegbe | first1=J. O. | last2=Akomolafe | first2=R. J. | title=The Foreign Relations Powers of the Nigerian National Assembly | journal=SAGE Open | volume=6 | issue=3 | date=2016 | issn=2158-2440 | doi=10.1177/2158244016658503 | doi-access=free }}\n* {{cite web | last=Abegunde | first=O. | title=Legislature and Democratic Sustainability in Nigeria | website=Semantic Scholar | date=2016 | s2cid=212453193 | url=https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/Legislature-and-Democratic-Sustainability-in-Abegunde/c1471a45bfb147da15316004a45e1524fc6b22c3 | access-date=9 February 2025}}\n{{Refend}}\n\n== External links ==\n* {{Official website|http://www.nass.gov.ng/}}\n\n{{Legislatures of Nigeria}}\n{{NigerianAssembly delegation}}\n{{Nigeria topics}}\n{{National bicameral legislatures}}\n{{Africa legislatures}}\n\n[[Category:National Assembly (Nigeria)| ]]\n[[Category:National legislatures|Nigeria]]\n[[Category:Government of Nigeria]]\n[[Category:Politics of Nigeria]]\n[[Category:Bicameral legislatures|Nigeria]]"}}}],"contentmodel":"wikitext","pagelanguage":"en","pagelanguagehtmlcode":"en","pagelanguagedir":"ltr","touched":"2026-10-29T04:15:43Z","lastrevid":1379214029,"length":25246}]}}